"howto":{"x":4400,"y":1460,"w":420,"fill":"blue","text":"Clickable happy path: press Play on M1 and follow M1 → M2 → M3, tap the QR to jump to the customer phone, then C1 → C2 → C3 → C4 → C6 → C7 → C9 → C10. ‘Continue on Paytm’ on C10 jumps back to the merchant’s M4.\n\nEvery customer screen has a working EN / தமிழ் toggle. Use each screen’s Tweaks to switch its state (empty, loading, wrong OTP, failed and so on)."},
